    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi akusanyika dza chitu chimwenga kpwenye muhala uriokala mbere za Ryango ra Madzi. Aho amuambira muandishi Ezira atuluze chitabu cha shariya za Musa ambazo Mwenyezi Mlungu waamuru Aiziraeli azilunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi siku ya kpwandza ya mwezi wa sabaa, mlavyadzi-sadaka Ezira wachireha cho chitabu cha shariya mbere za nyo mkpwutano wa alume na achetu na nyo arioweza kuphundza na kuelewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achichisoma kpwa raka ra dzulu kpwenye muhala uriokala mbere za Ryango ra Madzi hangu ligundzu hadi mutsi, mbere za alume, achetu na ariokala anaweza kuelewa. Osi ahega masikiro kuphundza chitabu cha shariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Ezira waima dzulu ya uringo wa mbao ambao kala ukadzengbwa kpwa ajili hiyo, kuno atu anjina aimire phephi naye. Uphande wa mkpwonowe wa kulume kpwaima Matithia, Shema, Anaya, Uriya, Hilikiya na Maaseya. Uphandewe wa mkpwonowe wa kumotso kuchiima Pedaya, Mishaeli, Malikija, Hashumu, Hashibadana, Zakariya na Meshulamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezira wachivugula cho chitabu kuno atu osi anamlola (kpwa mana kala a dzulu kushinda atu osi). Ariphokala anachivugula tu, atu osi angʼoka achiima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezira achimtogola Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu mkpwulu, nao atu osi achiunula mikono yao dzulu achijibu achiamba “Amina, Amina.” Achizama kumuishimu Mlungu hadi vilangu vyao vichiguta photsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyo atu ambao kala chila mmwenga aimire phatuphe aelezwa vinono zo shariya ni Alawi hano: Jeshuwa, Bani, Sherebia, Jamini, Akubu, Shabethai, Hodia, Maaseya, Kelita, Azaria, Jozabadi, Hanani na Pelaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi asoma cho chitabu cha shariya za Mlungu kpwa raka ra dzulu, achieleza manaye ili atu aelewe gokala ganasomwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyo atu arira ariphosikira go maneno ga shariya. Nehemia ariyekala ni liwali na Ezira yekala ni mlavyadzi-sadaka na Alawi ariokala anafundza achiambira atu osi kukala, “Siku ihi ni siku takatifu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu, msisononeke wala msirire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Nehemia achiaambira, “Phiyani mkarye vya kunona, munwe vya mtswano, chisha muaphirikire ayawenu ambao taana chitu, mana siku ihi ni takatifu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu. Tsona msisononeke, mana kuhererwa kahi za Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiyo nguvu zenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nyo Alawi achinyamaza atu osi, achiamba, “Nyamalani, msisononeke kpwa kukala siku ihi ni takatifu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi achiuya makpwao, achendarya, achinwa, achiphirikira atu seemu za vyakurya na achisherekeya kpwa raha sana mana kala akaelewa go maneno kala akaambirwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya phiriye, vilongozi a mbari zosi, alavyadzi-sadaka na Alawi akusanyika mbere za muandishi Ezira ili afundzwe maneno ga shariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.33+LEV.23.34+LEV.23.35+LEV.23.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 23:33–36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.39+LEV.23.40+LEV.23.41+LEV.23.42+LEV.23.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "39–43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.13+DEU.16.14+DEU.16.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 16:13–15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achimanya kukala kpwenye zo shariya za Mwenyezi Mlungu kala akaamuru kutsupira Musa kukala atu a Iziraeli ni asagale vibandani wakati wa sharee ya mwezi wa sabaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho kala ni amanyise atu osi neno riri, na aritangaze mwao midzini mosi na ko Jerusalemu aambe, “Tulukani muambuke myangoni mkarehe maphungo ga mierezi, maphungo ga mizaituni, mizaituni tsaka na maphungo ga mihadasi, makandza ga mitende na maphungo ga mihi ya makodza manji mudzenge vibanda dza irivyoandikpwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi atu osi achituluka achendareha vyo vitu achidzenga vibanda, chila mmwenga dzulu ya nyumbaye, mihalani mwao, kpwenye mihala ya nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu na kpwenye muhala wa Mryango wa Madzi, na kpwenye muhala wa Mryango wa Efuraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi ariokala akauya kula ko arikokala akahalwa mateka adzenga vibanda, achisagala mumo. Hangu wakati wa Joshuwa mwana wa Nuni hadi siku hiyo, Aiziraeli kala taadzangbwehenda hivyo. Nao achihererwa sana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila siku, kula siku ya kpwandza hadi ya mwisho, Ezira wasoma kula cho chitabu cha shariya za Mlungu nao achisherekeya siku sabaa, siku ya nane achikala na mkpwutano wa mwisho dza arivyolagizwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
